    "title": "NASA, SpaceX send four astronauts to International Space Station on Crew-13 mission - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorial ,\n5 hours ago NASA launched their latest flight to the International Space Station out of Cape Canaveral, Florida on Oct. 1. The Crew-13 mission took flight aboard a SpaceX Falcon 9 rocket at 11:10 a.m. EDT, carrying NASA astronauts Jessica Watkins and Luke Delaney, Canadian Space Agency astronaut Joshua Kutryk and Russian cosmonaut Sergey Teteryatnikov, according to NASA. Read full article",
